<title>SOUTH AFRICA: NEI CE appointed Rolls-Royce unit MD.</title>
<headline>NEI CE appointed Rolls-Royce unit MD.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chief executive of South Africa's NEI Africa Holdings Ltd, John Kempster has been appointed managing director of Rolls-Royce Plc's Industrial and Marine Power unit in the United Kingdom, NEI announced on Monday.</p>
<p>Kempster will take the appointment in July and will become a member of the Rolls-Royce Industrial Power Group board.</p>
<p>Kempster will remain a director of NEI. NEI will announce its new chief executive within the next couple of months.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
